        "description": "USN-7412-1 fixed a vulnerability in GnuPG. This update provides the corresponding update for Ubuntu 16.04 LTS and Ubuntu 18.04 LTS.  Original advisory details:   It was discovered that GnuPG incorrectly handled importing keys with  certain crafted subkey data. If a user or automated system were tricked  into importing a specially crafted key, a remote attacker may prevent  users from importing other keys in the future.",
